{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cice",
  "description": "CICE sea-ice top-level component (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the cesm3_cice6_6_3_22 ice component as an esm 1.3.0 assembly, per the stage1/boundaries.md 1.3 boundary table. Five systems: IceCap (mounted from ./cice_coupling.esm, the med<->ice cap renames, the med2mod/mod2med areacor scaling, and the merge_fluxes export aggregation of ice_import_export.F90), Thermodynamics (./cice_thermodynamics.esm, the BL99 column physics: prep_radiation shortwave/albedo, step_therm1 vertical conduction and surface energy balance, step_therm2 growth/melt/ponds and the ocean heat/fresh/salt fluxes), Dynamics (./cice_dynamics.esm, the EVP momentum balance and stress relaxation of step_dyn_horiz), Transport (./cice_transport.esm, the per-category conservative advection of the incremental-remap scheme), and the inline Control model, which is the ice_step orchestration (CICE_RunMod.F90:109-369 via ice_step_mod.F90) written as algebraic rate rules over one coupling period: the subcycling dt_dyn = dt/ndtd of the dynamics loop (CICE_RunMod.F90:271-281, ice_calendar dt_dyn), and the atmosphere boundary layer of the constant scheme (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:398-496): wind = sqrt(uatm^2 + vatm^2) (prepare_forcing, ice_forcing.F90:1796), tau = rhoa*0.0012*wind with the components strairx = tau*uatm, strairy = tau*vatm (F90:460-464), shcoef = senscoef*cp_air*rhoa*wind (F90:493) and lhcoef = latncoef*Lsub*rhoa*wind (F90:494, Lheat = Lsub for ice F90:472-476). The coupling array wires the data flow with variable_map param_to_var entries in the ice_step order: the cap state fields (potT, Qa, rhoa, the four shortwave bands, flw, sst, sss, frzmlt, frain, fsnow, uocn, vocn, ss_tltx, ss_tlty) into Thermodynamics and Dynamics; the transport-owned mass states aicen/vicen/vsnon into Thermodynamics, Dynamics, and the cap aggregation; the thermodynamics-owned enthalpy states qicen/qsnon into the Transport tracers; the dynamics-owned velocity uvel/vvel into Transport and the full ocean stress taux/tauy into the cap's Fioi_taux/tauy sign flip and the thermodynamics' ustar; and the per-category thermodynamics fluxes and albedos into the cap's export aggregation. Deferred to stage 3 (documented in the subcomponent descriptions and README.md): the Tsfc implicit surface-energy-balance solve (carried as a free parameter), the incremental-remap discretization of the transport PDEs (EarthSciDiscretizations lowering), the kstrength = 1 Rothrock ridging and the kdyn/ktherm alternates, the similarity atmbndy scheme, the per-band Fioi_swpen_* fields, and the wave/aerosol/isotope exports. The tests block is empty: the dynamics and transport subcomponents are now lowered onto the traced 3x5 subdomain with the EarthSciDiscretizations B-grid rules (their own dump pins live in their files), but the assembly couples those 3x5 systems to the single-cell Thermodynamics/IceCap through shape-mismatched variable_map edges (the validator accepts them with an UNKNOWN compatibility verdict), so the whole-coupling-period trace over [0, 3600] from the cold start remains a stage-3 concern. See README.md 'Testing'. Reference: stage1/cesm/components/cice/src/cicecore/drivers/nuopc/cmeps/.",
   "tags": [
    "cryosphere",
    "sea-ice",
    "cice",
    "cesm",
    "assembly",
    "coupling"
   ],
   "created": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z",
   "authors": [
    "EqESM project contributors"
   ],
   "references": [
    {
     "citation": "Hunke, E. C., Allard, R., Bailey, D. A., Blain, P., Craig, A., Dupont, F., ... & Roberts, A. F. (2023). CICE-Consortium Icepack v1.2.4 and CICE v6.3.22: documentation and user's guide. Los Alamos National Laboratory (LA-UR-23-31851)."
    },
    {
     "citation": "CESM (Community Earth System Model), ESCOMP/CESM: CICE sea-ice source (cesm3_cice6_6_3_22) - CICE_RunMod.F90, ice_step_mod.F90, ice_forcing.F90, icepack_atmo.F90 - the reference implementation these components are transcribed from.",
     "url": "https://github.com/ESCOMP/CESM"
    },
    {
     "citation": "EarthSciModels - the authoritative .esm corpus this component lives in.",
     "url": "https://github.com/EarthSciML/EarthSciModels"
    }
   ]
 },
 "solver": {
  "stiffness": "high",
  "time_span": {
   "start": 0,
   "end": 3600
  },
  "external": "cice.run.json"
 },
 "index_sets": {
  "cell": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_CELL"
  },
  "ncat": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_CAT"
  },
  "ice_layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_ILYR"
  },
  "snow_layer": {
   "kind": "interval",
   "size": "N_SLYR"
  }
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "N_CELL": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 1,
   "description": "number of ice grid cells in the stage-2 skeleton (one cell; the full model runs the block-decomposed B grid), [-]"
  },
  "N_CAT": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 5,
   "description": "number of ice thickness categories (namelist ncat = 5), [-]"
  },
  "N_ILYR": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 8,
   "description": "number of ice layers (D-class namelist nilyr = 8), [-]"
  },
  "N_SLYR": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 3,
   "description": "number of snow layers (D-class namelist nslyr = 3), [-]"
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "Thermodynamics": {
   "ref": "./cice_thermodynamics.esm"
  },
  "Dynamics": {
   "ref": "./cice_dynamics.esm"
  },
  "Transport": {
   "ref": "./cice_transport.esm"
  },
  "IceCap": {
   "ref": "./cice_coupling.esm"
  },
  "Control": {
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "./cice_templates.esm"
    }
   ],
   "variables": {
    "dt_dyn": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "dynamics timestep of the ndtd subcycle loop: dt_dyn = dt/ndtd (ice_calendar dt_dyn, passed to step_dyn_horiz, CICE_RunMod.F90:271-281), [s]"
    },
    "wind": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "wind speed at the lowest model level: wind = sqrt(uatm^2 + vatm^2) (prepare_forcing, ice_forcing.F90:1796, 1819), [m/s]"
    },
    "tau": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "N/m^2",
     "description": "atmosphere-ice momentum stress magnitude of the constant boundary-layer scheme: tau = rhoa*0.0012*wind (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:460), [N/m2]"
    },
    "strairx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/s^3",
     "description": "x air-ice stress at T points: strairx = tau*uatm (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:463; the per-category strairxn of step_therm1 is identical across categories - no Tsfc dependence - so the merge_fluxes aggregation of icepack_flux.F90:187-189 collapses to this single value). The Fortran omits the /wind direction-cosine normalization (the vmag division is commented out, F90:328-329), so the transcription carries the dimension kg/s^3 of the active code; the quirk is logged in README.md, [kg/s3]"
    },
    "strairy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/s^3",
     "description": "y air-ice stress at T points: strairy = tau*vatm (F90:464; see strairx for the missing /wind normalization), [kg/s3]"
    },
    "shcoef": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2/K",
     "description": "sensible-heat transfer coefficient: shcoef = senscoef*cp_air*rhoa*wind (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:493; senscoef = 0.0012, cp_air = 1005), [W/m2/K]"
    },
    "lhcoef": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "latent-heat transfer coefficient: lhcoef = latncoef*Lsub*rhoa*wind (atmo_boundary_const, icepack_atmo.F90:494 with Lheat = Lsub = 2.8347e6 for ice -- the nuopc-cap value, ice_comp_nuopc.F90:415-450, bugs.md #11 -- vs 2.835e6, F90:472-476; latncoef = 0.0015), [W/m2]"
    },
    "dt": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 3600.0,
     "description": "coupling/thermodynamics timestep (namelist dt = 3600 s; the step_therm1/2 column physics runs once per step), [s]"
    },
    "ndtd": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 1.0,
     "description": "number of dynamics subcycles per step (namelist ndtd = 1), [-]"
    },
    "uatm": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "x wind velocity at zlvl (wired from the cap import Sa_u), [m/s]"
    },
    "vatm": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "y wind velocity at zlvl (wired from the cap import Sa_v), [m/s]"
    },
    "rhoa": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^3",
     "default": 1.2,
     "description": "air density (wired from the cap import Sa_dens or the Sa_pbot branch), [kg/m3]"
    }
   },
   "equations": [
    {
     "lhs": "dt_dyn",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       "dt",
       "ndtd"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "wind",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "sqrt",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "^",
          "args": [
           "uatm",
           2
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "^",
          "args": [
           "vatm",
           2
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "tau",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "atmo_constant_tau",
      "bindings": {
       "rhoa": "rhoa",
       "wind": "wind"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "strairx",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tau",
       "uatm"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "strairy",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tau",
       "vatm"
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "shcoef",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "atmo_constant_shcoef",
      "bindings": {
       "rhoa": "rhoa",
       "wind": "wind"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "lhs": "lhcoef",
     "rhs": {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "atmo_constant_lhcoef",
      "bindings": {
       "rhoa": "rhoa",
       "wind": "wind",
       "Lheat": 2834700.0
      }
     }
    }
   ],
   "tests": []
  }
 },
 "coupling": [
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.uatm",
   "to": "Control.uatm",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "x wind into the atmo boundary layer (ice_import Sa_u)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.vatm",
   "to": "Control.vatm",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "y wind into the atmo boundary layer (ice_import Sa_v)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.rhoa",
   "to": "Control.rhoa",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "air density into the atmo boundary layer (ice_import Sa_dens or the Sa_pbot branch)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.dt",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.dt",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "column-physics timestep (step_therm1/2, CICE_RunMod.F90:240-252)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.dt_dyn",
   "to": "Dynamics.dt",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "dynamics timestep of the ndtd subcycle loop (step_dyn_horiz, CICE_RunMod.F90:279)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.strairx",
   "to": "Dynamics.strairx",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "T-point air-ice stress mapped to the U-point momentum balance (grid_average_X2Y of strairxT, ice_dyn_evp.F90:474-475; identity on the single-cell skeleton)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.strairy",
   "to": "Dynamics.strairy",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "T-point air-ice stress mapped to the U-point momentum balance"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.strairx",
   "to": "IceCap.strairxT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "T-point air-ice stress into the Faii_taux export (merge_fluxes strairxT, icepack_flux.F90:187-189)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.strairy",
   "to": "IceCap.strairyT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "T-point air-ice stress into the Faii_tauy export"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.shcoef",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.shcoef",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "sensible-heat transfer coefficient into the surface energy balance (atmo_boundary_const F90:493)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Control.lhcoef",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.lhcoef",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "latent-heat transfer coefficient into the surface energy balance (F90:494)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.potT",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.potT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "air potential temperature into the surface energy balance (ice_import Sa_ptem or the Sa_pbot branch)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.Qa",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.Qa",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "air specific humidity into the surface energy balance (ice_import Sa_shum)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.rhoa",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.rhoa",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "air density into the saturation humidity and surface energy balance"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.swvdr",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.swvdr",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "visible direct shortwave into the absorbed_solar/prep_radiation step"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.swvdf",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.swvdf",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "visible diffuse shortwave into prep_radiation"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.swidr",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.swidr",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "near-IR direct shortwave into prep_radiation"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.swidf",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.swidf",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "near-IR diffuse shortwave into prep_radiation"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.flw",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.flw",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "downward longwave into the surface energy balance (ice_import Faxa_lwdn)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.sst",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.sst",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "sea surface temperature into the ocean heat flux fbot (ice_import So_t)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.sss",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.sss",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "sea surface salinity into the bottom liquidus (ice_import So_s)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.frzmlt",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.frzmlt",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "ocean-to-ice heat flux into fbot (ice_import Fioo_q)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.frain",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.frain",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "rain rate (m/s) into the melt-pond volume change (ice_import Faxa_rain divided by rhofresh)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.fsnow",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.fsnow",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "snowfall rate into the new-snow thickness (ice_import Faxa_snow)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.aicen",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.aicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "advected category area into the column physics (the Fortran advects aicen before step_therm1 of the next step)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.vicen",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.vicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "advected category ice volume into the column physics"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.vsnon",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.vsnon",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "advected category snow volume into the column physics"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.aicen",
   "to": "Dynamics.aicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "category area into the strength and stress aggregation (aice = sum_n aicen)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.vicen",
   "to": "Dynamics.vicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "category ice volume into the strength and mass aggregation"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.vsnon",
   "to": "Dynamics.vsnon",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "category snow volume into the mass aggregation Tmass"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.aicen",
   "to": "IceCap.aicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "category area into the export aggregation (ailohi, Tsrf, fluxes)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.vicen",
   "to": "IceCap.vicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "category ice volume into the Si_vice export"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Transport.vsnon",
   "to": "IceCap.vsnon",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "category snow volume into the Si_vsno/Si_snowh exports"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.qicen",
   "to": "Transport.qicen",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "updated ice enthalpy into the advected tracer nt_qice (the conservative tracer transport is documented in the transport component, deferred to stage 3)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.qsnon",
   "to": "Transport.qsnon",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "updated snow enthalpy into the advected tracer nt_qsno"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Dynamics.uvel",
   "to": "Transport.uvel",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "B-grid x velocity into the remap advection (ice_HaloUpdate of uvel before transport, ice_transport_driver.F90:430-445)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Dynamics.vvel",
   "to": "Transport.vvel",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "B-grid y velocity into the remap advection"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.uocn",
   "to": "Dynamics.uocn",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "ocean surface current into the ocean stress vrel (ice_import So_u)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.vocn",
   "to": "Dynamics.vocn",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "ocean surface current into the ocean stress vrel (ice_import So_v)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.ss_tltx",
   "to": "Dynamics.ss_tltx",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "sea-surface slope into the tilt stress (ice_import So_dhdx)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "IceCap.ss_tlty",
   "to": "Dynamics.ss_tlty",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "sea-surface slope into the tilt stress (ice_import So_dhdy)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Dynamics.taux",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.strocnxT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "full ocean stress into the ustar of fbot (the single-cell skeleton collapses the T-point average of strocnxU/aiU of step_dyn_horiz, ice_step_mod.F90:1051-1072)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Dynamics.tauy",
   "to": "Thermodynamics.strocnyT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "full ocean stress into the ustar of fbot"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Dynamics.taux",
   "to": "IceCap.strocnxT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "full ocean stress into the Fioi_taux sign flip (tauxo = -strocnxT_iavg, ice_import_export.F90:966-968)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Dynamics.tauy",
   "to": "IceCap.strocnyT",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "full ocean stress into the Fioi_tauy sign flip"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.Tsfc",
   "to": "IceCap.Tsfc",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "per-category surface temperature into the Tsrf export aggregation (trcr(:,nt_Tsfc) of icepack_aggregate)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.flatn",
   "to": "IceCap.flatn",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "per-category latent heat flux into the Faii_lat aggregation (icepack_flux.F90:206)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.fsensn",
   "to": "IceCap.fsensn",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "per-category sensible heat flux into the Faii_sen aggregation (F90:204)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.swabs",
   "to": "IceCap.swabs",
   "transform": "param_to_var",
   "description": "per-category absorbed shortwave into the Faii_swnet aggregation (F90:210)"
  },
  {
   "type": "variable_map",
   "from": "Thermodynamics.flwoutn",
